#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/toolbars.rst:5
msgid "Element editor toolbars"
msgstr "元素编辑器工具栏"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/toolbars.rst:7
msgid ""
"In addition to the different menus, QElectroTech provides also toolbars. The"
" toolbars are groups of buttons with icons which initiate an action. In "
"general, these buttons have its counterpart at one of the menus from the "
"`menu bar`_."
msgstr ""
"除了不同的菜单之外，QElectroTech 也提供了工具栏。 工具栏是带有图标的按钮组，启动动作。 一般来说，这些按钮在 `菜单栏 <menu "
"bar_>`_ 中有一个对应的按钮 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/toolbars.rst:11
msgid ""
"The different toolbars can be hidden or placed in one or more rows below the"
" `menu bar`_. The toolbars can also be placed on column at the left or right"
" side from the main window."
msgstr "不同的工具栏可以隐藏或放置在 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 下的一个或多个行中，工具栏也可以从主窗口左侧或右侧放置在列上。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/toolbars.rst:16
msgid ""
"To help the user, a tooltip is displayed when the arrow is placed on each "
"button."
msgstr "为了帮助用户，当箭头放在每个按钮上时会显示工具提示。"

